		"description": "<p><em>Grenade Kit — Toolbelt option.</em></p><p><strong>Flame Grenade — 2 Actions, 1 Toolbelt scrap.</strong> Range 6, Blast 3, Damage: 2d6 Fire. On hit: applies Smoldering. Can still crit or miss. The area burns for 1 round; targets take INT Fire damage for each space they enter on a turn. This ignores armor.</p><p><strong>High Levels:</strong> +5 damage every 5 levels.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 1 Toolbelt scrap — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls 2d6 Fire (+5 per 5 levels) against each target — it can crit or miss — and applies Smoldering on a hit.</em></p><p><em>[M] The burning area (INT Fire per space entered, ignores armor) lasts 1 round — apply it as creatures move.</em></p>",
